flowchart LR
    Key[YubiKey<br/>Local PIN and private key]
    Browser[Browser<br/>WebAuthn and polling]
    App[Gateway service<br/>Flask and adapter]
    Flow[Broker and Flow<br/>Owner and response token]
    Database[MySQL<br/>Factors and grants]

    Key <-->|Local create and sign| Browser
    Browser <-->|HTTPS on port 443| App
    App <-->|Per-user DB connection<br/>Remote database TLS| Database
    App <-->|Owner-bound<br/>options and replies| Flow

    classDef user fill:#eef6f3,stroke:#47736b,color:#25342f;
    classDef service fill:#fcfaf7,stroke:#c74634,color:#312d2a;
    classDef database fill:#f0ece6,stroke:#625d58,color:#312d2a;
    class Browser,Key user;
    class App,Flow service;
    class Database database;
